{"words": [{"text": "وَٱتَّقُوا۟", "translation": "And fear"}, {"text": "يَوْمًۭا", "translation": "a day"}, {"text": "لَّا", "translation": "(will) not"}, {"text": "تَجْزِى", "translation": "avail"}, {"text": "نَفْسٌ", "translation": "any soul"}, {"text": "عَن", "translation": "for"}, {"text": "نَّفْسٍۢ", "translation": "(another) soul"}, {"text": "شَيْـًۭٔا", "translation": "anything"}, {"text": "وَلَا", "translation": "and not"}, {"text": "يُقْبَلُ", "translation": "will be accepted"}, {"text": "مِنْهَا", "translation": "from it"}, {"text": "شَفَـٰعَةٌۭ", "translation": "any intercession"}, {"text": "وَلَا", "translation": "and not"}, {"text": "يُؤْخَذُ", "translation": "will be taken"}, {"text": "مِنْهَا", "translation": "from it"}, {"text": "عَدْلٌۭ", "translation": "a compensation"}, {"text": "وَلَا", "translation": "and not"}, {"text": "هُمْ", "translation": "they"}, {"text": "يُنصَرُونَ", "translation": "will be helped"}], "sahih": "And fear a Day when no soul will suffice for another soul1 at all, nor will intercession be accepted from it, nor will compensation be taken from it, nor will they be aided."}